{"t": "2026-08-11T06:31:41.722082+00:00", "role": "atlas", "text": "Hey boss. What can I do for you?"}
{"t": "2026-08-11T06:31:42.675172+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "Here twice were filthy and serviced to Gondor."}
{"t": "2026-08-11T06:31:46.844643+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "A true esquire of Rohan."}
{"t": "2026-08-11T06:31:54.220405+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "Sorry."}
{"t": "2026-08-11T06:31:57.063180+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "This is not like Andrews."}
