{"t": "2026-08-11T06:32:04.479312+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "Well, that's no good. You won't kill many orcs with a blunt blade."}
{"t": "2026-08-11T06:32:05.500194+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "Come on."}
